/-!
# GST CLASSICAL HODGE — PI ONE-SOURCE COMPOSITIONAL-CORRESPONDENCE FINALE

This file removes the overstrong pointwise matrix-unit requirement from the
preceding finite-correspondence finale.

At one live Hodge weight we retain only one already genuine algebraic Hodge
source `S`.  For each requested Hodge basis sheet `j`, geometry supplies one
expression in the FULL noncommutative algebra generated by actual realized
finite closed correspondences under rational scaling, addition and ordered
composition.  The expression is required to hit the single source by a
nonzero rational scalar:

    E_j (cl(S.cycle)) = c_j * basis_j,   c_j != 0.

Nothing is required about the action of `E_j` on any other point, cycle or
Hodge vector.  Because every realized expression already has an exact native /
cohomological commuting square, applying `E_j` to the actual native source
cycle and dividing by `c_j` constructs the target basis cycle directly.

This is strictly weaker than:
* materializing every GST branch event;
* realizing a matrix unit on the whole Hodge fiber;
* realizing it on every native point atom;
* supplying an arbitrary ambient cohomology endomorphism;
* supplying target basis cycles.

Once the basis cycles are obtained, finite Hodge support reconstructs every
class.  The internal GST machinery is then used at full strength without
being confused with algebraicity: the same source/target branch exists in all
three sectors, the canonical live window carries its exact N-cohomology packet,
and every target persists through all finite levels of the unbounded higher-
causal cosmos.
-/

set_option maxHeartbeats 280000000
set_option maxRecDepth 1000000

noncomputable section

